{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cozy and relaxing experience.</strong> Unwind with satisfying puzzles as you place shapes onto hex-based boards and solve intricate image challenges. No timers, no pressure\u2014just pure puzzle-solving at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Engaging, Intuitive Gameplay</strong><br>Place shapes onto different board layouts, completing patterns and solving image-based puzzles. Each board offers a fresh challenge, keeping things interesting and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/extras/Gif1-small.png.gif?t=1742889376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>A Variety of Boards &amp; Challenges</strong><br>With a wide range of board shapes and unique puzzles, there's always something new to solve. Whether you're fitting pieces together or revealing an image, every puzzle is designed to be both relaxing and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1742889376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f <strong>A Warm, Relaxing Atmosphere</strong><br>Set in a cozy, sunlit living room, the game invites you to sit back and enjoy. The soothing color palette, soft lighting, and gentle sound design create a stress-free escape from the busy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1742889376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Perfect for Puzzle Lovers</strong><br>If you enjoy games that challenge your mind while letting you unwind, this is for you. Great for fans of relaxing, thought-provoking puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing, hexagon-based puzzles</strong> with intuitive mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No timers, no pressure</strong> \u2013 play at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beautiful, cozy aesthetic</strong> with hand-crafted visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</strong> and calming sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging puzzle boards\u00a0</strong>that gradually increase in complexity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554020?t=1742889376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554020?t=1742889376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/71336068079d30228999730bad643ccb5c3a5762/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742889376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/71336068079d30228999730bad643ccb5c3a5762/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742889376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3591810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cozy and relaxing experience.</strong> Unwind with satisfying puzzles as you place shapes onto hex-based boards and solve intricate image challenges. No timers, no pressure\u2014just pure puzzle-solving at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Engaging, Intuitive Gameplay</strong><br>Place shapes onto different board layouts, completing patterns and solving image-based puzzles. Each board offers a fresh challenge, keeping things interesting and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/extras/Gif1-small.png.gif?t=1742889376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f <strong>A Variety of Boards &amp; Challenges</strong><br>With a wide range of board shapes and unique puzzles, there's always something new to solve. Whether you're fitting pieces together or revealing an image, every puzzle is designed to be both relaxing and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1742889376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udecb\ufe0f <strong>A Warm, Relaxing Atmosphere</strong><br>Set in a cozy, sunlit living room, the game invites you to sit back and enjoy. The soothing color palette, soft lighting, and gentle sound design create a stress-free escape from the busy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554020/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1742889376\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Perfect for Puzzle Lovers</strong><br>If you enjoy games that challenge your mind while letting you unwind, this is for you. Great for fans of relaxing, thought-provoking puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing, hexagon-based puzzles</strong> with intuitive mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No timers, no pressure</strong> \u2013 play at your own pace</p>